.. rubric:: Blue User LED Blinky by GPIO

See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`blinky`.

.. zephyr-app-commands::
   :app: zephyr/samples/basic/blinky
   :build-dir: cytron_maker_pi_rp2040
   :board: cytron_maker_pi_rp2040/rp2040
   :west-args: -p
   :goals: flash
   :compact:

